  "description": "Up-and-coming actor Seo Gang-U is up for \"Rookie of the Year\" when his former lover, industry exec Lee Ji-Won, suggests they act like a couple in public. Although they are no longer dating, Ji-Won now needs Gang-U's help to create a dating scandal that will break off an engagement set up by her family. With his lingering affection for Ji-Won, Gang-U jumps at this chance to be close to her again. Although it's all supposed to be acting, will Gang-U's real feelings for Ji-Won blow everything? \n\n(Source: Tapas, edited)",
